Proof of Concept

1.  Simulate ingesting documents along with their Access Control Lists (ACLs).
2.  Store documents in a Vector Database with permissions metadata.
3.  Simulate a user querying the system, applying a metadata filter based on their mock identity.
4.  Generate a simplified, PM-friendly answer using an LLM.


Technical Stack

Language: Python
AI Framework: LangChain or LlamaIndex
Vector Database: ChromaDB (runs locally, no cloud setup needed for PoC)
LLM: Google Gemini API (or OpenAI/Claude)
Interface: A simple Command Line Interface (CLI) or a lightweight web UI using Gradio/Streamlit.
